note as CLINICAL_CUSTODY
  CLINICAL CUSTODY AND RLS
  Every clinical aggregate that can exist without an encounter carries an explicit
  custodian_tenant_id. Child records inherit custody from their parent and database
  constraints prevent cross-tenant parent/child links. RLS evaluates custodian,
  patient scope, purpose of use, consent/privacy directives and emergency override.
end note

note as OBSERVATION_VALUE_CONTRACT
  OBSERVATION VALUE CONTRACT
  value_type_concept_id selects exactly one value family. Named CHECK constraints
  enforce mutual exclusivity across scalar, quantity, range, ratio, sampled data,
  attachment and governed reference values. Multi-performer, reference-range,
  specimen, device, body-site and absent-data semantics are explicit.
end note



